      "id": "1318727311318486",
      "score": 5,
      "review_title": "I. Love. EVERYTHING!",
      "review_description": "This is one of the most beautiful games I have stumbled across. You start off on Gili island (real place) and raise, fight, and go on adventures with pets! I love the variety of fishes and the ambience this game has aswell! Me personally, I LOVE marine biology, so this game really intrigues me since you can explore such a vast ocean! The colors are beautiful, the idea of teamwork, and even the hawaiian aesthetic boost my love for this game even more! I love that games like this can teach kids the importance of everyday science while still being so educational! I even love how the concept of the +5% for an egg everytime someone helps, this just proves that teamwork is useful in ANY situation.",
